; form.glyph — fields, a submit button and a confirmation label.
SCREEN 44 9
SET status "fill in both fields"
SET sent 0
PANEL p 0 0 44 9 "Register"
LABEL l1 2 2 "Name:"
FIELD name 9 2 20 submit
LABEL l2 2 4 "Node:"
FIELD node 9 4 12 submit
BUTTON go 9 6 "Submit" submit
LABEL st 20 6 :status
ON submit [SET status "submitted" ADD sent 1]
